### 1. Login del administrador en ms-auth (perfil dev: admin@costostock.cl / Admin12345)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "correo": "admin@costostock.cl", "password": "Admin12345" }

> {%
    client.global.set("admin", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 2. Registrar un VENDEDOR en ms-auth (queda PENDIENTE). Si ya existe, responde 409: sigue igual.
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "vendedor@mail.cl",
  "password": "clave12345",
  "nombre": "Tienda Central",
  "role": "VENDEDOR",
  "ficha": {
    "businessRut": "76.123.456-0",
    "legalName": "Tienda Central SpA",
    "businessActivity": "Venta de alimentos",
    "activityStartDate": "01/03/2020",
    "region": "Valparaíso",
    "commune": "Valparaíso",
    "street": "Av. Pedro Montt 1820",
    "municipalPatentNumber": "PAT-12345",
    "sanitaryResolutionNumber": "RES-6789"
  }
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) client.global.set("vendedorId", response.body.id);
%}

### 3. El administrador aprueba al vendedor
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/admin/users/{{vendedorId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "APROBADA" }

### 4. Login del vendedor
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "correo": "vendedor@mail.cl", "password": "clave12345" }

> {%
    client.global.set("vendedor", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 5. Registrar y hacer login de un CLIENTE (para comprobar que NO entra)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "correo": "cliente@mail.cl", "password": "clave12345", "nombre": "Ana Cliente" }

### 6. Login del cliente
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "correo": "cliente@mail.cl", "password": "clave12345" }

> {%
    client.global.set("cliente", response.body.accessToken);
%}


### 7. Listar productos (VENDEDOR) -> 200 (trae 3 de ejemplo en el perfil dev)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{vendedor}}

### 8. Crear producto con oferta de 60 minutos (VENDEDOR) -> 201
POST http://localhost:8082/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{vendedor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pan amasado x6",
  "description": "Horneado hoy",
  "category": "Panadería",
  "storeName": "Tienda Central",
  "address": "Av. Pedro Montt 1820",
  "originalPrice": 2000,
  "offerPrice": 1200,
  "offerDurationMinutes": 60,
  "stock": 10,
  "imageUrl": "",
  "pickupHours": "Lunes a viernes 9:00 a 18:00",
  "co2SavedKg": 0.5
}

> {%
    client.global.set("productoId", response.body.id);
%}

### 9. Ver un producto
GET http://localhost:8082/api/productos/{{productoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{vendedor}}

### 10. Solo mis productos, o buscar por texto
GET http://localhost:8082/api/productos?mios=true&q=pan
Authorization: Bearer {{vendedor}}

### 11. Editar el producto (sin offerDurationMinutes se mantiene el fin de la oferta)
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/productos/{{productoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{vendedor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pan amasado x6 (integral)",
  "category": "Panadería",
  "storeName": "Tienda Central",
  "originalPrice": 2000,
  "offerPrice": 1000,
  "stock": 7
}

### 12. Un CLIENTE intenta listar -> 403
GET http://localhost:8082/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### 13. Un CLIENTE intenta crear -> 403
POST http://localhost:8082/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "No debería", "category": "X", "storeName": "X", "originalPrice": 100, "stock": 1 }

### 14. Sin token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8082/api/productos

### 15. El vendedor intenta editar un producto de ejemplo (no es suyo) -> 403
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/productos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{vendedor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Ajeno", "category": "X", "storeName": "X", "originalPrice": 100, "stock": 1 }

### 16. El administrador sí puede editar cualquiera -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/productos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Pack Yogur Batido 12x120g", "category": "Lácteos", "storeName": "Supermercado Central Valparaíso", "originalPrice": 4990, "stock": 6 }

### 17. Eliminar el producto (VENDEDOR dueño) -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/productos/{{productoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{vendedor}}
